WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Draw across the saved cylinder; the line is reflected around its axis.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.300
The source stroke and reflected copy are now editable.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.200
Orbit to inspect the curved result.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.000
Synthetic replay uses no pressure data.
